<h1> Tribute to Dhermendra</h1>
<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>Dharmendra, fondly known as the <em>He-Man of Bollywood</em>, is one of the most iconic actors in Indian cinema. With a career spanning over six decades, he has charmed audiences with his versatility, charisma, and timeless performances.</p>
<h2>Early Life</h2>
<ul>
<li> Born: December 8, 1935, in Punjab, India</li>
<li> Background: Raised in a humble family, Dharmendra’s journey to stardom is a story of perseverance and passion.</li>
<li>- Inspiration: His love for films began in childhood, and he pursued acting against all odds.</li>
</ul>
