<h3>Legacy</h3>
<ul>
<li> Over <strong>300 films</strong> across romance, action, and comedy.</li>
<li> Recipient of the <strong>Filmfare Lifetime Achievement Award</strong>.</li>
<li> Revered as one of the most handsome and charismatic actors of his era.</li>
<li>His sons Sunny Deol and Bobby Deol, and daughter Esha Deol, continue his cinematic legacy.</li>
</ul>
